msgid "先判断你要改变什么，再进入对应小表。不要从四十张卡片中逐个试："
msgstr ""
"Decide what you need to change before opening the corresponding table; do"
" not try forty cards one by one:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:18
#: 33de996c4eb24899872c9ddd15105b07
msgid ""
"没有初始结构\n"
"└─ 从标准晶型开始 → 晶体原型构建\n"
"\n"
"已经有初始结构\n"
"├─ 改晶胞 → 晶格\n"
"├─ 重排坐标或复制层状结构 → 结构\n"
"├─ 生成自由表面 → 表面\n"
"├─ 加随机位移或模态位移 → 扰动\n"
"├─ 改元素和组成 → 合金与组分\n"
"├─ 删位、插入原子、吸附或层错 → 缺陷\n"
"├─ 改磁矩 → 磁性\n"
"├─ 做分子或溶剂 → 分子与溶剂\n"
"└─ 不再生成，只想清洗或选代表结构 → 筛选\n"
msgstr ""
"No initial structure\n"
"└─ Start from a standard crystal prototype → Crystal Prototype Builder\n"
"\n"
"Existing initial structure\n"
"├─ Change the cell → Lattice\n"
"├─ Rearrange coordinates or replicate layered structures → Structures\n"
"├─ Create a free surface → Surfaces\n"
"├─ Add random or mode-based displacements → Perturbations\n"
"├─ Change elements or composition → Alloys and Composition\n"
"├─ Remove sites, insert atoms, add adsorbates, or create faults → Defects"
"\n"
"├─ Change magnetic moments → Magnetism\n"
"├─ Work with molecules or solvents → Molecules and Solvents\n"
"└─ Stop generating and clean or select representative structures → "
"Filtering\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:34
#: 669b0de6db0c42dc80f22653ae600f1f
msgid "如果一条任务跨越多步，例如“生成表面并加入吸附原子”，先找改变边界条件的主卡， 再接局部操作卡。完整串联方式见[配方示例](recipes.md)。"
msgstr ""
"When a task spans multiple steps, such as generating a surface and adding"
" adsorbates, choose the card that changes the boundary conditions first, "
"then add local-operation cards. See [Recipes](recipes.md) for complete "
"workflows."

