#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:112
#: f64d96a2d44742a1853690ed33e8225e
#
msgid "表面薄层扫描 vs 全局空位"
msgstr "Surface Slab Scan vs. Global Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:114
#: 42c0e3eabb5648e69ef92620827e8d75
#
msgid "`表面薄层扫描` 改的是边界条件和表面取向，结果会引入真空层与自由表面。"
msgstr "`Surface Slab Scan` changes surface orientation and cell geometry, introducing vacuum and free surfaces."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:115
#: f7bbbf0fcb514d3b9648ef83cb08b109
#
msgid "`全局空位` 控制体相或表面结构中的整体删位数量。"
msgstr ""
"`Global Vacancy` controls the total number of sites removed from a bulk "
"or surface structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:116
#: da8a5fb2d56b4970875d7f0bc7483ccd
msgid "想研究表面空位，通常先 `表面薄层扫描`，再接 `全局空位` 或 `定向空位`。"
msgstr "To study surface vacancies, usually run `Surface Slab Scan` first and then connect `Global Vacancy` or `Targeted Vacancy`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:118
#: 95f30c032f1647a2826788f7bdb84155
msgid "随机掺杂 vs 成分空间采样 vs 随机占位"
msgstr "Random Doping vs. Composition Space Sampling vs. Random Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:120
#: 7dbcc2908e554b1a94600f0e4ec0de3d
#
msgid "`成分空间采样` 负责定义“目标配比空间”，输出仍是带目标配比标签的结构副本。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` defines the target composition space; its "
"output remains structure copies carrying target-composition labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:121
#: b1d0303324cf400e8acd944d157b44f4
#
msgid "`随机占位` 负责把目标配比真正落到离散原子位点上。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` realizes each target composition on discrete atomic "
"sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:122
#: b57615d11c7a45baac0217f455d31d8e
#
msgid "`随机掺杂` 更适合“给定规则后直接做一次随机替换”，而不是系统地扫完整配比空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` is better for applying explicit random substitution rules"
" than for scanning a complete composition space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:124
#: 2a03c41febd143ca8dbf3ef459a978f9
msgid "有序合金原型 vs 有限晶胞合金占位"
msgstr "Ordered Alloy Prototype vs. Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:126
#: 0e8bb19a04d54c6fb9e031698a73b1c5
#
msgid "`有序合金原型` 建立晶胞、周期边界、分数坐标和 A/B 晶体学子晶格，不负责枚举组成。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype` creates the cell, periodic boundaries, "
"fractional coordinates, and crystallographic A/B sublattices; it does not"
" enumerate compositions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:127
#: f599c30c6195457cb5bdb0ce5d9252b5
#
msgid "`有限晶胞合金占位` 接收已有位点或子晶格，先确定可实现的整数计数，再生成不重复排布。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` accepts existing sites or sublattices, "
"first determines realizable integer counts, and then generates unique "
"arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:128
#: b23908ebe64648a4b82b09af9880266b
msgid "要覆盖 L1₂、B2、L1₀ 的有序到部分无序路径，通常先生成原型，再做有限晶胞占位。"
msgstr ""
"To cover ordered-to-partially-disordered paths for L1₂, B2, and L1₀, "
"generate the prototype first and then apply finite-cell occupancy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:130
#: fb8398784f4c4cdfa7ff5c79dc61ee60
msgid "原子扰动 vs 振动模式扰动"
msgstr "Atomic Perturb vs. Vib Mode Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:132
#: 8386c3f3cbfd4f0595c309253f13aa49
#
msgid "`原子扰动` 是无模型的随机位移，适合快速补近平衡噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` adds model-free random displacements for quick near-"
"equilibrium augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:133
#: 20a04010e1e3432dad2bbb2d91cbbcfc
#
msgid "`振动模式扰动` 基于已有振动模态，适合更接近特定频率空间的位移采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` uses existing normal modes to sample selected regions "
"of vibrational-coordinate space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:134
#: e57d7c4816da45908e3b97b7273f1573
#
msgid "输入里没有模态数组时，不能直接用 `振动模式扰动`。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` cannot operate until the input contains recognized "
"mode arrays."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:136
#: 92b66898967e4a8f9bf2bd64f5dbccfd
msgid "层错只保留一个新建入口"
msgstr "Use one creation entry for stacking faults"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:138
#: 0d071096dfbc4eee835bd132affa0a8a
#
msgid "新任务统一使用 `层错路径`，当前晶胞的 `ab` 面就是层错面；用户填写面内方向 `[u v]`、切面位置和位移路径。"
msgstr ""
"Use `GSFE Path` for new workflows. The current cell's `ab` plane is the "
"fault plane; specify the in-plane direction `[u v]`, the cut position, "
"and the displacement path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:139
#: b16ed78b198f4571a6000278dcaed8a4
#
msgid ""
"它不限材料，但要求输入已经定向：第三晶胞方向必须垂直于当前 `ab` 面。普通 cubic fcc cell 若要扫原始 `(111)` "
"面，应先用 `晶体原型构建` 的 `fcc111` 原型或自行构造已定向晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"The card is not restricted to a particular material, but the input must "
"already be oriented: the third cell direction must be perpendicular to "
"the current `ab` plane. To scan the original `(111)` plane of a "
"conventional cubic fcc cell, first use the `fcc111` prototype in `Crystal"
" Prototype Builder` or construct an oriented cell yourself."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:140
#: 4ee376ab2539492cb04cfe49ca30adc2
msgid ""
"旧 `StackingFaultCard` 仍保留在序列化注册表中，用于载入历史 "
"JSON；因为它自动从全局笛卡尔轴推导滑移方向，所以不再显示在“添加新卡片”和“查找卡片”中。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy `StackingFaultCard` remains in the serialization registry for "
"loading historical JSON. Because it derives the slip direction from "
"global Cartesian axes, it is no longer shown in `Add new card` or `Find "
"card`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:142
#: dd6009550acf4b8da722c6a3e09d4a13
msgid "设置磁矩 vs 磁序 vs 磁矩旋转"
msgstr "Set moments vs. magnetic order vs. moment rotation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:144
#: 89169ca31e4944c6ae5d1a8ca772f2bb
#
msgid "`设置磁矩` 只负责把磁矩写进去，适合静态初始化。"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` writes one consistent moment state and is intended"
" for static initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:145
#: 57c1cb35594440a9bb074a136ffceec8
#
msgid "`磁序` 会生成 FM / AFM / PM 等多磁态分支。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` branches into FM, AFM, and PM-like initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:146
#: 4d3a1d1624654dcfa17e0933b4e0ffca
#
msgid "`磁矩扰动` 在已有磁矩周围随机补样，适合覆盖参考磁态附近的局部涨落。"
msgstr ""
"`Spin Perturb` samples random variations around existing magnetic moments"
" and is suitable for covering local fluctuations near a reference "
"magnetic state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:148
#: 1166a00fe16f42a8b774b1910a9ac48e
msgid ""
"磁性卡片对外统一使用 NEP / Show NEP 的 `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ 字段。卡片内部仍同步维护 ASE 的 "
"`initial_magmoms`，用于兼容 ASE 操作和旧工作流；导出文件只保留 `spin`。读取已有磁矩时优先使用 "
"`spin`，只有输入没有 `spin` 时才回退到旧的 `initial_magmoms`。标量模式会按卡片中明确设置的 `Axis` "
"转成三分量 `spin`；零向量 Axis 会明确失败，不会静默假设方向。"
msgstr ""
"Magnetic cards use the NEP / Show NEP `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ field as their "
"external contract. Internally, they also keep ASE `initial_magmoms` in "
"sync for ASE operations and legacy workflows; exported files retain only "
"`spin`. Existing moments are read from `spin` first and fall back to "
"legacy `initial_magmoms` only when `spin` is absent. Scalar mode converts"
" values to three-component `spin` vectors using the card's explicit "
"`Axis`; a zero Axis fails clearly instead of silently assuming a "
"direction."

